window.products.push({"id":976058,"name":"Cool Mist Humidifier for Large Bedroom: Ultrasonic Air Vaporizer for Room - 5L Top Fill Humidifiers Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zkkOtrC0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This product can be used as a cold water humidifier as well as a colorful night light. It has two working modes: fog and light. These two modes can work individually or together. Features: 1.5L large capacity water tank, working time up to 42 hours. 2.7 soothing light colors and 2 adjustable light modes (automatically change/fix one color). 3.3 timers: 12H/6H/2H. 4.4 kinds of fog modes, can adjust strong fog and weak fog. 5. The top filling design is convenient to add water and easy to clean. 6. Does not contain BPA, non-toxic and harmless. 7. Using ultrasonic technology, the working sound is small. 8. When the water runs out or the time is up, the humidifier will automatically shut down. 9.2 360°rotating nozzles, the direction of mist can be adjusted freely. Usage steps: 1. Remove the lid; 2. Insert the power cord; 3. Add an appropriate amount of water (be careful not to exceed the capacity of 5L); 4. Close the lid and press the ON/OFF button. Button description: 1. Press the \"MIST+\" button to increase the fog, and press the \"MIST-\" button to weaken the fog. 2. Press the \"ON/OFF\" button to turn the humidifier on or off. 3. Press the \"TIME\" button to set the time, you can see if the time indicator lights up. 4. Press the \"LIGHT\" button to turn on/off the light, and adjust the light to change the mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zkkOtrC0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Humidific","source_asin":"B0B5Q91TSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5Q91TSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5Q91TSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976059,"name":"Kalchugino Metal Works USSR Coat of Arms Classic Russian Tea Glass Holder/Russian Podstakannik for Hot or Cold Liquids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GFVmwbbwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Glass holders were invented at the end of the XVIII century. The main reason for their creation was the etiquette, which allowed women, but not men, to drink tea out of porcelain cups. Men had to use glasses, which got hot very quickly, making it difficult to drink tea. The men's troubles were finally over, when one very creative mind finally invented the glass holder, which later became a staple at every train car table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GFVmwbbwL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalchugino Metal Works","source_asin":"B00AAFGJZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AAFGJZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AAFGJZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
