window.products.push({"id":976098,"name":"Ezprotekt Φ1.57 x 2 Inch Round Bed Risers - Solid Steel Bed or Furniture Post, Creates an Additional 2\" of Height or Storage! Heavy-Duty Table, Chair,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MV2ZdnHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ezprotekt 4PACK round 2 inch bed will help you creating additional space. ▶▶▶Do you ever trouble that your apartment not equipped with enough storage space? Need more space but don’t want the hassle or cost of a storage unit? ▶▶▶Do you ever struggle standing up out of furniture that is too low to the floor,specially developed to boost seat ergonomics by raising low sitting furniture to a safer and more comfortable height level that eases the sit to stand process,these 2 inch tall furniture risers are the great solution ! Our bed risers will add an extra 2 inches, allowing you to have extra storage below your bed and finally get your home organized. Create extra space under your bed, couch ,sofa, garage, office, and gym etc. ▶▶▶Built for strength and durability, a set of 4 of these heavy-duty furniture risers will support 20,000 pounds (5000 lbs per riser cup lift),solid carbon steel design ensure these furniture risers wll not crack. Increase Comfort, Increased Health ◆◆Having trouble with adjusting furniture heights? Our bed risers can help achieve the perfect height for your needs. ◆◆Having trouble sleeping due to a health condition? Use our bed risers to adjust the height of your bed (or just one end). This will save you time and allow you to be more productive by feeling better and getting more sleep. Extra Stability and Peace of Mind Do you worry the addition of bed risers might damage your flooring or make your bed unstable? Our bed risers with the bottom of non-woven fabrics design will provide great protection for your floors. Package Included 4 Pack of 2 inch bed risers (Black)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MV2ZdnHrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ezprotekt","source_asin":"B086W39HYY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976098","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086W39HYY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086W39HYY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
