window.products.push({"id":976106,"name":"NOVICA Brown Hand Crafted Teakwood Cheese Board with a Handle, 'Quiet Grove'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WIBdymtTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Carved from teak wood, this rectangular-shaped cheese board features a minimalist design with a handle at one end for easy carry. Indonesia's Putu Muliawan polishes the wood with coconut oil that accentuates its natural grain. Because no stains are used, the natural wood colors and grain will vary from piece to piece.  - Food safe - Hand-crafted item -- color, size and/or motif may vary slightly - Wood grain and color can vary slightly   About our Artist: 'My name is Putu Muliawan and I was born in Bali in 1986, the youngest of five siblings. As a child, I would help my parents around our family farm. My friends describe me as a diligent and honest man. I'm married and have a son. He gives me more spirit to fight and inspires me to work harder so I can give him a better future. My hometown, located on northern coast, is known for weaving palm leaves. I helped my uncle weave table runners, place mats, coasters, bags and many more items. I used my earnings for my school tuition and to buy food. After graduating from high school, I started my own workshop and sold weavings for more than 11 years. Today, woven tableware is not as popular anymore soI decided to begin creating wooden dishes. Together with four assistants, I craft tableware in sono, teak and sawo woods, which are food-safe. They are sanded or simply coated with olive or coconut oil to enhance the natural wood grain.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WIBdymtTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01MS8IBX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MS8IBX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MS8IBX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976107,"name":"Barnyard Designs Buffalo Plaid Window Curtain Panels for Kitchen, Living Room, Bedroom, Graphite and Ivory Gingham Check Rod Pocket Curtains, Farmhous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obIFaqDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Buffalo Plaid Curtains: Our trendy buffalo plaid checkered fabric window curtains are made of soft and durable material that feels like linen. Featuring large, oversized gingham checks woven with a rustic weave that’s rich in texture to bring a fresh, lively look to your windows all year round. The checked flannel pattern on these curtain drapes have a true farmhouse flair to them. Chic and decorative window curtains that are perfect to hang in a kitchen, living room, bedroom, dining room, or doorway, they’ll instantly add a French country farm decor look to your home. Care: Machine wash cold with like colors. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. Hang, cool iron or steam to release wrinkles. Filters sunlight to allow natural room light. Valences do not contain fire retardants. For indoor use only. Direct sunlight may cause color to fade slightly over time. Features: Set of 2 checker curtain panels. Material: 70% polyester/30% cotton. Measures: 52” L x 0.25” W x 84” H. Color: Graphite and Ivory. Fits up to 1.25” diameter rod. Includes 2, 11.75” L x 3” H tie backs. For indoor use only.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81obIFaqDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barnyard Designs","source_asin":"B0BLY5TRR2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLY5TRR2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLY5TRR2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
