window.products.push({"id":976141,"name":"Custom handmade Damascus Blade Kitchen knife/chef knife (01, Orange)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XjlMTrAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Damascus For This Knife Was Created By Forge Welding Multiple Layers Of Steels Into A Solid Block Called A Billet (15N20 &1095 High Carbon Tool Steels). The Billet Is Folded & Re-Welded Several Times To Produce Several Layers. Patterns Are Created By Manipulating The Steel During The Forge Welding process. When acid is added to the blade, it Attacks The Layers Of Hard & Soft Steels Differently, Highlighting The Attractive Layered Pattern In The Steel.The Combination Of Layered Hard & Soft Steel Creates Blade Flexibility, Toughness & Produces Invisible Serrations On The Blade That Aid Cutting. The Hardness Of The Blade Is 55-60 HRC On Rockwell Scale. MEASUREMENT Over All Size: 11.5\" Blade Size : 6.5\" and Handle Size: 5\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XjlMTrAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MADISON","source_asin":"B07NPY5DNM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NPY5DNM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NPY5DNM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
