window.products.push({"id":976187,"name":"27Brands New Set of 10 Reusable Stainless Steel Drinking Straws 8.5'' (5 Straight, 5 Bent & 2 Cleaning Brushes) – BPA Free Metal, Thick, Long, Dishwas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618aGoIqlCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Enjoy A Cool Sip No Matter What! Have you had enough with straws … … that are easily broken? … not wide or comfy enough? … that make your drinking experiences a nightmare? Maybe looking for a more eco friendly way? If so, then you should keep on reading. 27Brands proudly presents its brand new set of stainless steel straws. Each pack includes 10 reusable straws, 5 straight and 5 bent. Along with the straws you will get 2 Bonus brushes for effortless washing and cleaning. Impressive Durability, Long Lasting Drinking Comfort, Endless Uses! These reusable straws are the perfect combination of elegance, practicality and affordability. Why spend a small fortune on disposable straws when you can get this 18/8 stainless steel reusable straw set? In addition to being eco friendly and non toxic, our metal straws are durable, rust proof, warp resistant, odorless and BPA free. Unlike bamboo straws, they will not degrade over time, unlike other metal straws, they will leave no metallic taste, and unlike glass straws, they will never break after repeated uses. Their compact and long size 8.5'' (21.5cm) makes them compatible with most 20 and 30 Oz tumblers, trail cups, mason jars and drinking vessels out there. Like Yeti, RTIC, Ozark and others! These Fancy Stainless Steel Straws Are Perfect For: · … indoors and outdoors. · … BBQ fiestas and family gatherings! · … garden, balcony or pool parties. · … cocktail nights. · … bars, cafes and restaurants. · … special occasions and celebrations. · … picnics, boating, camping, traveling and more! Slurp Up Your Drinks In Style! Click Add To Cart Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618aGoIqlCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"27Brands","source_asin":"B07DNMK2G5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DNMK2G5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DNMK2G5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976188,"name":"Advanced Mixology [Gift Set] Moscow Mule Mugs - 100% Pure Copper Mugs, 16 Ounce Set of 4 Stylish Designed Mugs with 4 Artisan Hand Crafted Wooden Coas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BdNy2TgOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AUTHENTIC MULE MUGS: The original moscow mule cocktail from 1941 was consumed in copper mugs to make it a stylish affair. Keeping this important tradition in mind, we have created for you the highest quality mule mugs. We are proudly, the only brand which makes our moscow mule cups set of 4 with 22-gauge thick sheets. Our mugs are handcrafted by multi-generational artisans to create the distinctive hammered moscow mule set. LAB-TESTED & FOOD SAFE COPPER CUP SET of 4: Just like you, our family and friends love and enjoy a moscow mule, kentucky mule, and other refreshing cocktails. We wanted to make sure that our mugs were safe not just for our family but for yours as well. To ensure your peace of mind while using our copper mule mugs, our moscow mule mugs have been rigorously tested and certified for food safety by a licensed third party lab. PERFECT GIFT SET FOR THOSE YOU LOVE: Our copper cups for moscow mules are perfect as a Father's day gift, Mother's day gift, Christmas Gift or as a copper anniversary gift. The lavish giftable box containing the moscow mule set comes with 4 copper straws, 4 elegant coasters, 1 shot glass, 1 stirring spoon & 1 cleaning brush. Use the shot glass to make a perfectly measured moscow mule, stir it up with the spoon & sip the refreshing drink using the straws while the coasters protect your tables. EASY TO MAINTAIN: Copper mugs naturally tarnish, but to ensure that you have long lasting, beautiful & solid copper mugs, the exterior of our moscow mule mugs has a proprietary tarnish resistant finish, while the inside of the moscow mule copper mugs is stainless steel. Make sure to only handwash these mule mugs. There are also specialized copper cleaning solutions you can buy, or you can use a combination of salt and vinegar, and ketchup. Don't worry all instructions are included in the box. LIFETIME WARRANTY: We are two friends from Seattle, who quit our jobs to focus on bringing to you the highest quality cocktail glasses. We take extreme pride in our product and and we aim to provide you with the very best copper mugs. To demonstrate our commitment, we offer a NO QUESTIONS ASKED 100% REFUND GUARANTEE. Please reach out to us in case of any issues and we’ll promptly fix it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BdNy2TgOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Mixology","source_asin":"B01CBOGTBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976188","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CBOGTBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CBOGTBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
