window.products.push({"id":976236,"name":"Set of 3! Color Changing LED 4\" Starburst Indoor Tree Ornaments; Extra Batteries Included for a full Season of Light!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315hgqngkEL._AC_.jpg","description":"These color changing starbursts create a magical display of light anywhere in your home. This set of three four inch LED hanging starbursts includes a 24/6 hour timer. Each individual starburst has a slow color changing LED that operates on one CR2477 battery and each has its own hook & suction cup battery case and timer. The hook and suction cup on the battery compartment allows you to hang these starbursts from any tree or window. Each starburst will glow on one set of batteries for almost a month, turning on and off by themselves at the time you designate. Set includes six CR2477 batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/315hgqngkEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mr. Light","source_asin":"B003JQKXUY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976236","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003JQKXUY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003JQKXUY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976237,"name":"American Art Decor Vintage LED Marquee Wall Decor - Battery Operated Metal Wall Art With LED Light Bulbs - Retro Sign for Bar, Man Cave, Garage, Game ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d69jsfYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some vintage-inspired wall decor to your home bar, man cave or game room with this LED marquee sign. This dual sided retro sign is made from high quality materials like strong and sturdy galvanized metal for a look that will last. Our catchy piece of wall decor has hints of vintage charm and character. The weathered and distressed look and feel of this piece truly makes it feel like a hidden gem from yesteryear. Featuring energy efficient LED bulbs that light up your gaming area or outdoor living space, customize any space with our bright marquee sign. Whether you're looking to decorate your professional bar, pub, or add some flair to your basement bar or bedroom, this dynamic sign will captivate attention with its classic look. Powered by two AA batteries (not included), you can truly hang our vintage room decor anywhere with out two keyhole hooks. There's no need to worry about unsightly or tangled cords with our easy on/off toggle switch conveniently located on the side of our metal marquee wall art. A perfect gift idea for Father’s day, Mother's Day, birthdays, or for anyone that loves a old timey look, this LED sign will surely stand out and shine bright! PRODUCT SPECS: Dimensions: 25\" H x 9\" L x 4\" D , Weight: 3 lbs, Includes 5 LED bulbs + 1 replacement bulb, On/off toggle switch, Requires 2 AA batteries (not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d69jsfYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"American Art Decor","source_asin":"B07KXCFJKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KXCFJKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KXCFJKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976238,"name":"Frigidaire EAF180-WHITE, 1.8 Qt Air Fryer-Oil-Free Healthy Cooking-Digital Controls-Removable, Dishwasher-Safe Pan and Tray, 1.8qt, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wiMX+PRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compact size. Big flavor. Utilizing the latest advances in rapid-air technology, This air fryer circulates hot air at high speed, cooking your favorite dish and producing a crispy fried Texture with little or no oil. You can make a variety of food; almost any food that is traditionally cooked in the oven can be air fried! Adjustable 30-minute timer and auto shut-off function allow you to program your fryer to achieve amazing results without overcooking your food. The 2-liter fryer basket and tray are removable and dishwasher safe, so your meal is as easy to clean as it is healthy and delicious. The personal and compact size air fryer saves space on your counter and in your cabinet; perfect for any small kitchen, dorm room, RV trips, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wiMX+PRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B09WB2TN5N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WB2TN5N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WB2TN5N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
