window.products.push({"id":976258,"name":"Wire Storage Baskets, Metal Wire Organizing Bins Baskets with Handles for for Kitchen Bedroom Cabinets Pantry Bathroom Laundry Room Closet Garage 2 Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IVepTY9fL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"How you keep your backstock items? Throw them on the ground or stack loose in the pantry? How you store your meal size portion food in the freezer? Will them fall in the freezer anywhere or fall out? Do you find your plastic food organizer cracks and becomes brittle very soon? Give every item a place with the pantry helper metal wire basket. Great for storing loose content and keeping all the loose things together in each group. * The wire basket perfect for kitchen supplies, household supplies and office supplies, it can storage snacks, drinks, cans, bottles, jars, grain, toys, bath soaps, shampoos, linens, towels, laundry needs, pet foods and toys, books, school supplies, files and more; You can place this storage baskets anywhere to add storage and get organized * Use in bathroom, bedroom, closet, laundry room, utility room, garage, hobby and craft room, home office, mudroom and entryways; Perfect for homes, apartments, condos, dorm rooms, RVs and campers.  * Also use it in deep kitchen drawers for tuperware lids, measuring cups, and others in drawer. * The food storage basket is ideal freezer organizer for chest freezer, upright freezer, side by side freezer to provide a simple but heavy duty storage solution. Store your meat/steak/fruit/vegetable/drink/a lot of zip lock bags, and more. Product features: * Made of strong steel wire with a durable rust-resistant finish, lightweight but heavy duty. * The simple design works with any decor. * This wire storage basket with 4 built-in handles, just grab and go. Store, move, and reorganize with minimum effort. Great for delivering. * The wire spacing lets you see at-a-glance the item you want. * Easy clean with cloth. * These baskets are no sharp corners and finish, no harm to pet or child. * These organizer baskets can be hang sideways on the wall or shelf with hooks(those are not included), sturdy enough.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IVepTY9fL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WenZBros","source_asin":"B089GND4W8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GND4W8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GND4W8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
