window.products.push({"id":976260,"name":"1, 2 or 3 Tiers Stack able Wine Rack ~ Counter top Wine Holder ~ Cabinet Storage ~ Metal Wine Stand (White Finish, 1 Tier)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZtuucqxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"STYLE & FUNCTION: When guests come over, bust out your favorite wine in style with this Free-Standing Countertop Tabletop Metal Wine Rack, which is an excellent addition to your kitchen and home bar décor. This chic wine rack is crafted from durable metal with grooves in each tier, where you can conveniently rest your favorite wine bottles. These wine racks come in two colors: white and rustic brown; to suit your decor style. SECURED STORAGE OF WINE BOTTLES: Our elegant wine rack is made with thick, solid iron specially treated with an anti-rust bronze or white finish. This Wine rack stores bottles more securely! So NO MORE wobbly wine rack, just enjoy the peace of mind. LONGER LASTING WINE : Similar to a wine cellar storage, storing wine bottle horizontally can keep corks moist to make wine last longer. Our wine holder is designed to hold wine bottles just like wine cellar storage. Want to store more wine bottles?, Just place few of these elegant wine rack together and you have your mini wine cellar. SPACE SAVER & STACKABLE: Compact kitchen? Running out of room in the dining room? Not to worry. With each rack (tier) at 17\"W x 7\"D x 4\"H, this wine rack keeps your bottles corralled without taking up valuable square footage. And each rack can be used alone or stacked as needed. PERFECT GIFT : Your beloved would not be happier when receiving such a nice gift on Valentine's Day, Christmas, New Year, Birthday or Wedding. We only source quality products. We are so confident in our products that we offer a 100% risk-free satisfaction guarantee; no questions asked. So, order now and give your wine bottles a place of their own with this must-have wine racks for your wine bottles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZtuucqxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hivory","source_asin":"B07TZWM69C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TZWM69C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TZWM69C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
