window.products.push({"id":976326,"name":"Howard Miller Princeton Floor Clock 611-138 – Lightly Distressed Hampton Cherry Grandfather Home Decor with Quartz, Triple-Chime Movement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MwPRx36hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FLOOR CLOCK: The Princeton Floor Clock has a Hampton Cherry finish on select hardwoods and veneers, lightly distressed dents for an aged appearance to be ideal vertical decor in the home. The design includes plain glass, a swan-neck pediment, turned urn finial, and decorative shell overlay and olive ash burl patterned back and bottom panel. DURABLE: This gorgeous floor clock has a sturdy wood frame with adjustable levelers to provide stability and relieve stress in a busy household. Kids can be kept out with the convenient locking door. The polished brass-finished dial contains corner spandrels, center disk, silver chapter ring, black Arabic numerals, and stationary midnight blue moon phase. CHIMES: Receive quartz, triple-chime movement that plays a choice of full Westminster, or Ave Maria chimes with strike on the hour and ¼, ½, and ¾ chimes accordingly. The Westminster chimes and strikes on the hour only or the Bim Bam chime only on the hour. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off for volume control to have in any room. The polished brass-finished pendulum and decorative weight shells add a beautiful touch. DIMENSIONS: The height of this clock is 77.25 inches (196 cm), with a width of 19.25 inches (49 cm) and a depth of 11 inches (28 cm). Powered and operated by a quartz, triple-chime movement and requires two C and two D sized batteries (not included). Made in the USA. HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world’s leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MwPRx36hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B000KXDU9U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000KXDU9U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000KXDU9U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
