window.products.push({"id":976336,"name":"XREXS Large Digital Wall Clock WiFi Sync, 16.5 in Large Display Wall Clock with Temperature/Date/Week, LED Big Digital Timer Clock, Alarm Clock for Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zd85yk5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASY TO SETUP & INTERNET TIME SYNCHRONIZED ----- Simply connect the WIFI, the large digital wall clock will automatically set to the correct time. The convenient auto set features makes setting the clock become much easier and no more setting hassles. This large LED wall clock can automatically adjusts to Daylight Saving Time, hassle free to reset time manually. JUMBO DISPLAY WALL CLOCK WITH AUTO-DIMMING ​----- 16.5\" extra large LED display with big bold digits make it much easier to read anywhere in the room. This big digital wall clock can show the time, date, month, day and temperature, bring you clear and comfortable visual sense. Auto dimming based on the light levels, no glaring light at night but bright enough to read time. ACCURATE DATE & TIME ----- This large display digital wall clock can automatically sync the time to the second by connecting to WIFI, making it more accurate than ordinary electronic clocks. Once it has successfully connected to WIFI, there is no need to install AAA batteris for backup and reset the clock, even after a power outage. It will automatically update the time. Therefore, it is ideal for people in need of accurate timekeeping. MULTI-FUNCTIONAL ----- The large digital clock has multiple uses, it not only gives you the time, but it can also be used as an alarm clock to wake you and as a large digital timer to help you keep time. You can just press mode button to change mode, easy to operate. In addition, the led digital wall clock can be switched to display 12 or 24 hours and ℉ or ℃ to meet your various needs. WIDE APPLICATION WALL MOUNTED CLOCK ----- Our large wall clock come with a power plug, so you don't have to change batteries often. Featuring 2 hanging holes and a fold out stand, it can not only be placed on the nightstand, but also hung on the wall. Modern design and practical house decorations, suit for living room, kitchen, office, garage, office, gym and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zd85yk5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XREXS","source_asin":"B09YD8D49V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YD8D49V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YD8D49V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
