window.products.push({"id":976442,"name":"Wakit Electric Herb Grinder - Single Press Grind - Easy to Use, Fast and Custom Grind Consistency - LED Lighted Grinding Chamber","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TdenQa8AL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","description":"EASY TO USE: Place your hand on the Wakit Cap and use a quick short tap for a coarse consistency, like it finer? Add another quick short tap, the more you tap it the finer the consistency. Ideal for all users, the Wakit Grinder makes getting the perfect grind consistency attainable and easy. NO MORE TWISTING - Is your wrist tired of twisting traditional grinders and mills? Are your current grinders more work to use than they’re worth? That’s why the Wakit Electric Ginder was created, to stop the manual twisting of a grinder and provide a simple, and fast solution. Whether you suffer from sore joints in your hands or are sick of clearing jammed grinders, those problems will be in your past with the Wakit Herp Ginder BALL and CHAIN GRINDING - A single beaded chain is connected to a touch-activated drone motor. The chain spins creating a vortex shaving the herb from the thick stems and creating a perfect texture. You can customize the texture of your grind by simply pressing the grinder down longer for a finer texture. EASY TO CLEAN - Cleaning is a breeze simply using a moist towelette or an alcohol towelette, as Wakit Grinders will not gunk up since Wakit does not crush your spices or dry culinary plants (thyme, lavender, oregano, sage, marjoram, basil, tarragon). It is that easy! PURCHASE INCLUDES - 1 Wakit KLR Grinder (the design you select), 1 Micro USB Charging Cable, and 1 User Manual. NOTE: No other items are included in your purchase. A round bottom 3” tray is sold separately as an accessory. The Wakit Tray DOES NOT come with your purchase and it is sold separately. We recommend using a clean flat surface or your tray of choice","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TdenQa8AL._AC_SL1488_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wakit Grinders","source_asin":"B09DSD18HV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSD18HV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSD18HV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
