window.products.push({"id":976495,"name":"RESPAWN Specter Full Mesh Ergonomic Gaming Chair, Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M7RUDqFRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the heat turns up, the RESPAWN Specter Full Mesh Ergonomic Gaming Chair is at the ready to keep you cool and comfortable. The three-part contoured full mesh gaming chair allows maximum air circulation while providing the cradling support of flexible mesh. The PU leather headrest gives you a soft yet solid spot to rest your head in between battles, features the cool embroidered RESPAWN logo, and adjusts in height and tilt for individual customization and comfort. We know gaming sessions can sometimes last hours, the built-in lumbar area allows for targeted support throughout your gameplay. The armrests feature 3D adjustability allowing you to personalize height, arm pivot, and front and back placement. Ergonomic touches are a gamer's best friend and this chair has plenty! Synchro-tilt control allows for a smooth recline action, the seat slide adjusts the seat's depth for users of varying heights, and the tilt tension controls the speed and ease of recline. The five-star base with 360-degree swivel and pneumatic height adjustment accounts for users of different heights. This video game chair has a 275 lb weight capacity and measures 27.2\" W x 25.8\" D x 46.5\" - 53\" H. An award-nominated brand, RESPAWN is committed to your satisfaction and covers this chair with our RESPAWN 5-Year Limited Warranty. Keep cool in the most challenging settings from team meetings to online gaming with the RESPAWN Specter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M7RUDqFRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RESPAWN","source_asin":"B08DS8RR3K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DS8RR3K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DS8RR3K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976496,"name":"Black and White Striped Rug 28 x 45 Inches Front Door Mat Hand-Woven Cotton Indoor/Outdoor Rug for Layered Welcome Door Mat, Front Porch,Farmhouse,Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5141LGv5R-L._AC_.jpg","description":"Decorate your home with style with our black and white Striped rug!Our front door mat is Super Popular in Pinterest,put it on your front porch with a WELCOME door mat on top. Very cute layering! Receive your guests with elegance! the latest and most trendy farmhouse decor! This classical black and white rug is versatile for indoor or outdoor use. It can be used as a doormat, bathroom rug, porch mat, kitchen mat, apartment rug, area rug, entry door rug.You name it! Features: ⭐Its tight weave features slight irregularities that make each rug one of a kind. ⭐This Black and White Striped Rug is sturdy, expertly woven construction comes from its handmade craftsmanship. ⭐Embrace its bold, graphic pattern for your rustic or urban interiors and style it as a minimalist or traditional statement. ⭐Easy to care and use,Vacuum clean,Machine wash with mild detergent and water,Hang dry.  ⭐This black and white rug is made to withstand any conditions, and are double sided for even longer life. ⭐Best choice for House Warming gifts, Mother’s Day gift, Christmas gift, Holiday gift, and Thanksgiving gifts. 100% SATISFIED CUSTOMER SERVICE: It is our commitment to provide our customers with the Top Grade products and services ,if you have any question,please feel free contact us at first,We will meet your all request,return or refund is available,make you satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5141LGv5R-L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yinyi","source_asin":"B07WRM77F6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WRM77F6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WRM77F6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
