window.products.push({"id":976659,"name":"ALASKA BEAR - 100% 19 Momme Mulberry Silk Bed Sheet, Seamless Flat Top Sheet, Hypoallergenic, Twin, Charcoal Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cLXuh4ZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alaska Bear-- Enhance your Life   Silk sheet is cool, breathable and Hypoallergenic, it does't suck moisture from you skin surface and great for sensitive skin. When you sleep on a silk sheet, it doesn't rub your skin and hair, but keep you dry and comfortable, best choice and ideal gift for everyone. Dimensions: Fitted Sheets: Twin: 39 x 75 inches + 16 inches (99 x 191 cm + 40 cm) Full: 54 x 75 inches + 16 inches (137 x 191 cm + 40 cm) Queen: 60 x 80 inches + 16 inches (153 x 203 cm + 40 cm) King: 78 x 80 inches + 16 inches (198 x 203 cm + 40 cm) California King: 72 x 84 inches + 16 inches (183 x 213 cm + 40 cm)  Flat Sheets: Twin: 66 x 96 inches (168 x 244 cm) Full: 81 x 96 inches (206 x 244 cm) Queen: 91 x 102 inches (231 x 259 cm) King/California King: 108 x 102 inches (274 x 259 cm) Care and composition: Hand washing is recommended for our 100% natural Mulberry silk sheets. Hand wash in cold or lukewarm water with mild detergent. Do not soak dark-colored silk for more than three minutes. To help retain color, add a few drops of distilled white vinegar to final rinse. As silk becomes more delicate when wet, do not twist or wring. Hang dry. Do not dry in direct sunlight. Though hand-washing is preferable, you may machine wash in cold water on the gentlest cycle with mild detergent. Do not bleach. Wash silk separately from other items. Hang dry. Do not dry in direct sunlight. Machine drying is not recommended.  Wrinkles in silk should disappear with time, and so ironing is not recommended. If you must, only iron the reverse side of the damp silk with your iron set on the lowest setting.  Please enjoy your mulberry silk product, which brings a feeling of cool, relaxing luxury to every night of sleep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91cLXuh4ZqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALASKA BEAR","source_asin":"B072LVB5JN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072LVB5JN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072LVB5JN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":976660,"name":"UUPP Potted Artificial Hydrangea Rose Flowers Bonsai Plant Fake Camellia Flowers with Pot Silk Flower Arrangements for House Office Restaurant Table C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwRWjQzHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: Material: Silk flowers and leaves +Plastic stems + Metal Pot Total size: approx 8.66\" H X 7.87\" in diameter Package: 1 x Artificial Hydrangea Rose Potted Flowers This faux flower will never die off, and easy take care of it. so that it can be a nice decoration for a long time.Tips: Leaves can be installed easily if falling. After a long time shipping, flowers may have a little deformation, with a hair dryer or hot steam can be restored. Please gently spread the item after getting it, in case of falling the leaves and flowers. There would be accumulated dust if you put it in a place for very long time.You can use the hair dryer with cold wind to remove the dust. Please don't put it under strong sunshine.You'd better to dry it by the natural wind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AwRWjQzHL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UUPP","source_asin":"B07YRKG1WT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YRKG1WT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YRKG1WT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
