window.products.push({"id":976709,"name":"windaze White Nightstand with 2 Storage Drawers, Wood X-Design Tall Nightstand and Storage, Bedside End Tables for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":114.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qvt6ev5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THOUGHTFULLY MADE- The white nightstand is crafted from a blend of solid pine and manufactured wood for an extra sturdy and durable piece that’s built to last. Its water-based coating with low VOC is splashproof yet family-friendly. Best of all? Supported by anti-tip straps, this end table’s 2 under-shelf drawers lower the center of gravity downward for exceptional stability. EASY&STYLISH- This tall white nightstand is brimming with farmhouse-meets-modern flair: It has a clean silhouette, tapered legs, open shelf with X-shaped accents on the sides, all finished in a crispy white tone that highlights the beauty of the night stand while the black handles make a touch of contrast. Plus, the top tier has rounded corners for an elegant look and safety. AMPLE STORAGE- Gliding smoothly on the metal track, the 2 soft-close drawers of the bedside tables are perfect for out-of-sight storage. The sleek handles allow for an effortless pull in or out, so you can tuck away necessities in delightfully handy. Best of all? The night table top and upper shelf offer more than enough room for showing off your to-read books and potted plants. VERSATILE FORM- The well-made side tables with an understated look that pairs well with just about any design aesthetic. It’s right at home next to your bed in the bedroom, plus it can also function as an end table in your living room or a storage chest in the entryway. Why not add this white nightstand to your house for both decorative and functional? BREEZILY ASSEMBLE&FRESHEN UP- The bedroom table comes with easy-to-follow instructions and necessary tools for an easy assembly process. Its solid wood tabletop is treated as water-repellent while providing the function you need to store and entertain. When the bed stand needs a little freshening up, we suggest applying it with a soft damp cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qvt6ev5cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"windaze","source_asin":"B09SPYBMDJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-976709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SPYBMDJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SPYBMDJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
